# Fault f2b_keylist_bal (writer 6): `bal(konto, d) for d in [2026-12-31, 2027-12-31]` was refused LOAD-UNIT ("the
# day of bal is keylist"). L §2.5: a variable over a key list takes its index from its key positions; d has none, and
# its keys are days; L §4.2 Keys as values: "a key of a year, month or day index is a value of that period type" (as
# writer 5 did for years in a span end). pay moves 10.00 PLN out of konto (opening 0) on the first of each month: 12
# payments by 2026-12-31 (-120.00 PLN), 24 by 2027-12-31 (-240.00 PLN).
=== m.tally
model m
  tally 2
  on 2027-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2027-12-31

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place world: outside lives 2026-01-01..

index month = month 2026-01..2027-12

input amt: money PLN

move pay[m in month]: transfers
  on start_of(m)
  leg cash from konto to world amount amt

source s "x"

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 10
  opening[konto] = 0 at 2026-01-01 start


ask q: bal(konto, d) for d in [2026-12-31, 2027-12-31]
=== expect
q (d = 2026-12-31): -120.00 PLN
...
q (d = 2027-12-31): -240.00 PLN
...
